        "blockName": null,
        "blockType": "relatedCaseStudyBlock",
        "title": "A real example of how I work",
        "framingText": "I don't have a published case study specific to technical audits yet, but here's a real look at how I work with clients."
      },
      {
        "id": "6a544f5c140e75434aba4dd1",
        "blockName": null,
        "faqs": [
          {
            "id": "6a544f5c140e75434aba4dcd",
            "question": "How long does a technical audit take?",
            "answer": {
              "root": {
                "type": "root",
                "format": "",
                "indent": 0,
                "version": 1,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "format": "",
                    "indent": 0,
                    "version": 1,
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "It depends on the size of the site. A mid-sized one, up to around 500 indexable URLs, usually takes one to two weeks, from tool access to the prioritized report.",
                        "type": "text",
                        "version": 1
                      }
                    ],
                    "direction": "ltr"
                  }
                ],
                "direction": "ltr"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "6a544f5c140e75434aba4dce",
            "question": "Do you just hand off a report, or do you also implement the fixes?",
            "answer": {
              "root": {
                "type": "root",
                "format": "",
                "indent": 0,
                "version": 1,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "format": "",
                    "indent": 0,
                    "version": 1,
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Both options exist. By default I deliver a prioritized, actionable report for your team to implement. If you'd rather I implement the fixes in the code myself, we scope that as an extension: no need to bring in a separate developer for the technical part.",
                        "type": "text",
                        "version": 1
                      }
                    ],
                    "direction": "ltr"
                  }
                ],
                "direction": "ltr"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "6a544f5c140e75434aba4dcf",
            "question": "What tools do you use?",
            "answer": {
              "root": {
                "type": "root",
                "format": "",
                "indent": 0,
                "version": 1,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "format": "",
                    "indent": 0,
                    "version": 1,
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "A mix of technical crawlers, Google Search Console and Analytics, Lighthouse and CrUX for field Core Web Vitals, and manual code review for the cases automated tools miss, mostly rendering issues in JS frameworks.",
                        "type": "text",
                        "version": 1
                      }
                    ],
                    "direction": "ltr"
                  }
                ],
                "direction": "ltr"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "6a544f5c140e75434aba4dd0",
            "question": "Does the audit work if I didn't build my own site?",
            "answer": {
              "root": {
                "type": "root",
                "format": "",
                "indent": 0,
                "version": 1,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "format": "",
                    "indent": 0,
                    "version": 1,
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Yes. Most audits I run are on sites I didn't build. The diagnosis is stack-agnostic; implementing the fixes depends on how accessible your codebase is.",
                        "type": "text",
                        "version": 1
                      }
                    ],
                    "direction": "ltr"
                  }
                ],
                "direction": "ltr"
              }
            }
          }
        ],
